  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "• 『機動戦士ガンダム THE ORIGIN』の世界観が舞台のメカニカル考証企画「MSD（Mobile Suit Discovery）」より、一年戦争末期にザクIIをベースに開発された高性能MS「アクト・ザク」が、「ペズン計画」を主導したキシリア部隊仕様でHG化！",
      "en": "• From the mechanical investigation project \"MSD (Mobile Suit Discovery)\" set in the world of \" Mobile Suit Gundam THE ORIGIN \", the high-performance MS \" Acto Zaku \", which was developed based on the Zaku II at the end of the First War, has been made into HG with the Kycilia unit specifications that led the \" Pezun Project\"!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• キシリア部隊所属機の特徴である頭部の「クレスト」が新規造形で再現され、新規造形となる4連装マシンガンと専用ヒート・ホーク2本が付属する！",
      "en": "• Characteristics of machines belonging to the Kycilia unit The \"crest\" on the head is reproduced with a new model, and a new 4-barreled machine gun and 2 dedicated heat hawks are included!"
    }
  ],
